                                                "text": "January 31 2020, Boris Johnson, Brexit Day speech\nAnd when I look at this country’s incredible assets. Our scientists, our engineers, our world-leading universities, our armed forces. When I look at the potential of this country waiting to be unleashed, I know that we can turn this opportunity into a stunning success."
